      "json_pointer": "/readers/reader-b/answers/1/answer",
      "text": "Separate Powers cannot combine Bringer\u2019s hypothetical Damage: 2 Damage and then separate 1 Damage do not destroy the undamaged City or earn Fear. If 2 then 1 are instructions within one Power, they can combine to hypothetically destroy it, earning 5 Fear and pushing it. A Repeat can pretend-destroy the same piece again for Fear."
    },
