      "json_pointer": "/readers/reader-b/answers/1/evidence/0/text",
      "text": "For each Power use, evaluate what it would destroy if resolved normally: generate **0 Fear per Explorer, 2 per Town, 5 per City**, and Push the would-be-destroyed Explorers/Towns."
